<[Dennis] D.RUFFER> to find out what you are looking for in a
                    glossary... the pocket guide (updated BTW)
                    really doesn't tell you much at all... and we
                    want to be sure you get what you need
                    (whatever your need is :)
<GILES> Jus th basic pF words, Dennis...preferably ALL of them.
                    (grin)
<[Dennis] D.RUFFER> is there apurpose behind the curiosity?
<GILES> I think pF is prolly th most advanced...... & would like
                    to model my own system after it.... At least
                    what I consider it's BEST points. (grin)...
                    Prolly use some different words, tho.
<[Dennis] D.RUFFER> hum, a competetor huh?   wellllll...... the
