<GILES> Oh, I don't intend to "rip it off"...... I already have
                    first versions of my own system...
<[Dennis] D.RUFFER> the list of words really is not more and
                    probably less than  most other Forths
<GILES> but don't wanna miss any really elegant ideas that pF may
                    have.... Less is BETTER!
<[Dennis] D.RUFFER> ah, but the list of words is NOT where the
                    ideas are...... it is how we put them
                    together that makes them ellegant
<GILES> But a glossary is not just a list...also definitions....
                    Jus a starting point for ideas.
<[Dennis] D.RUFFER> ah, well we haven't done a "real" glossary
                    for ages... if you want to sign a non-
                    disclosure agreement...
<GILES> Yah?
<[Dennis] D.RUFFER> we can let you buy a manual, but that is
