<GILES> That sounds reasonable.  Not $3K I hope. (smile)
<[Dennis] D.RUFFER> nope, I don't know the price, but it is
                    reasonalbe... that is why Randy needs to call
                    you
<GILES> Swell!  I'd definitely b interested.
<[Dennis] D.RUFFER> did you give me your phone number with your
